Z||000000||rockcrawl||09-11-2000||05:26 PM||||I don't understand how Pontiac could cancel production of the Fiero, yet they can introduce something as ASS-UGLY as the new Aztec. That really iritates me. I hope the Aztec is a complete flop. I'm starting to see them on all the dealers lots, but I've yet to see one on the road. What do you guys think? Pontiac lovers deserve something better than the Aztec! Sorry if anyone here owns one.<P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'86 GT 3800 (for sale)<BR>'87 GT (noisey 2.8)<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)||||reg||13
