Z||000014||HugGRRRFiero||09-11-2000||11:00 PM||||Sorry, I don't actually have one Pontiaddict.  If I were to have one, It would have to be hugger orange, or orange with a gold pearl in it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I think the black side cladding would look pretty cool next to the orange.  But unfortunately GM Pontiac decided to stick with conservative colors as usual instead of setting a trend, and probably will be about 5 years before they even consider adding a color.||||reg||1
